    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88341" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προποδ-ισμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>process, progression,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ μονάδος</span> Moderat. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>Coroll.</u>
				8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριθμός ἐστι π. πλήθους</span> TheoSm.<i><span class="en">
				p.18H.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. εἰς τὸ ὂν τοῦ ἑνός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					67
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>direct motion,</i> of planets, pl., opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποποδισμοί,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Hyp.</u>
				7.4
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναποδισμοί,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Ar.</u>
				1.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				440.7
			</span></i>.</div>
